WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.601
- Well, you got married
since the last time.

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:04.090
- I got married, yes.
- I know, congratulations.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.320
- Thank you.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.760
I was actually on your show,

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.560
like right before we got
married and I was like,

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.530
Kelly, I'm getting married
in a couple of weeks.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.932
- [Kelly] I love the color of your suit.

00:00:13.932 --> 00:00:14.765
- Look at that.

00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:18.990
Yeah, we did a last minute
wedding where we weren't really,

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.460
we didn't think we were
gonna be able to get married

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.160
this past year, with the pandemic

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.630
'cause we were gonna
have, like, a real thing.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:31.020
And then in, like, September, October,

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.260
we were just like, let's just get married.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.410
Like, why are we waiting?

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.350
- Yeah, save your money
and buy something cool,

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.830
like a house.
- Heck, yeah.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.320
No, for real.
- Rather than a wedding.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.600
- Yeah, so we planned it
in, like, three weeks.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.960
We had five friends get tested

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.290
and we kind of did an outdoor thing,

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.540
as you see, on the beach

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.490
and we ended up zooming our families.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.520
But I didn't think about that in advance

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.610
because you just don't
think about, you know,

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.510
zooms and weddings.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.930
And it's like 10 minutes
before the ceremony,

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:05.770
I'm like, oh, we should
probably zoom our families

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.530
and so, I'm like frantically
trying to get a zoom link going

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:12.240
and the internet was down.
- I don't know how to do that.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.960
- And so, you know we're
like sending it out,

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.550
we're like, we hope we remembered
to send it to everybody,

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.010
we forgot a few people.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.241
- I think that, you
know, it's a good pass,

00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:23.970
the whole global pandemic thing.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:24.803
- Yeah.
- It's a good,

00:01:24.803 --> 00:01:26.480
it's a good like, hey, we tried.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.860
- We tried.
- There was effort.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:30.080
- Yeah, and I for sure
saved a lot of money

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.340
'cause my family we're
southern, we like to eat.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.860
That would have bankrupted me,

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.390
just the food.
- Just the food and drinks.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:39.030
If you're southern it's
the food and drinks.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.120
- Yeah, my mom doesn't
like any of the fancy food.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.898
She'd be like, you got any sliders?

00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:45.420
- [Kelly] Sliders, fried chicken?

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.354
- I don't want any of this ahi tuna.

00:01:47.354 --> 00:01:48.313
(both laughing)

